      <slug></slug>
      <title>Cypher Query Language </title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Graph Processing Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Cypher is a declarative query language recently added to the Neo4j graph database. In this talk we explain the motivations for creating this language, describe its current features and design, and dive a little into its implementation. Finally, we discuss the future direction of how we expect the language to evolve.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description></description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2681">Andrés Taylor</person>
      </persons>
